<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see rain west, sun east.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see rain west, sun east.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Monday were forecast to see rain west and sun in the east, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see thundershowers except in the south with highs of 22 to 26 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see sunny skies and highs of 22 to 26 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see sunny skies and highs of 26 to 28 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
